+// The equip and use fixture (profile use_race, client script 8: the transfer
+// driver's steps, CampaignEvent 7). Once both players are in the world each
+// actor gets a medkit (two uses), bread, a detector, a pistol, a second
+// medkit, a tin of conserva and an artefact, and is set to half health and
+// low satiety; an inventory box appears between them. Equip steps (action
+// 9) carry the place in `extra` and the inventory slot in flags bits 4-7;
+// flags bit 3 sends the intent directly instead of through the engine's
+// inventory path (the refusal cases, and a use the client's own scripts would
+// refuse before asking). Use steps (action 10) go through the installed UI's
+// path (`CInventory__eat`, then `db.actor:eat`), or with extra 1 through the
+// engine's GEG_PLAYER_ITEM_EAT event (CInventory::ClientEat, the quick-use
+// key). A medkit's booster lasts 33.4 s, and the installed scripts refuse a
+// second one meanwhile (itms_manager), so a medkit's second use comes 40 s
+// after its first.
+//   0 equip          p1 the detector to slot 9; p2 the pistol to slot 1 (the knife goes to the ruck first)
+//   1 unequip        both to the ruck
+//   2 refusals       p1 the detector to slot 2 (20); p2 p1's bread (14); p1 uses the detector (21);
+//                    p2 an undefined place (2); p2 its artefact to the belt (20 without belt slots)
+//   3 eat            p1 its medkit (2 -> 1 uses); p2 its bread (used up), at the same tick
+//   4 boosters       p2 its medkit (Accepted: p1's medkit booster is p1's); p1 its second medkit (22:
+//                    its own booster is still active)
+//   5 use vs move    p1 uses its conserva and moves it to the box at the same tick (use first);
+//                    p2 moves its conserva to the box and uses it at the same tick (move first): one outcome each
+//   6 quick-use key  p1 its bread through the GEG_PLAYER_ITEM_EAT event
+//   7 equip again    p2 the pistol to slot 3; p1 the detector to slot 9
+//   8 last use       p1 its medkit's second use (used up)
+//   9 disconnect     p2 its medkit's second use, then drops its connection at once
+//  10 pickup         p1 picks up the bread that has lain at its feet since the set-up (a pickup record)
+//  11 eat it         p1 eats that bread: after a restart neither the pickup's record nor anything else
